claim.claim-text:
a pump system for providing fluid inflow from a fluid source (60) and fluid outflow returning to the fluid source;
a controller (25) and control algorithms; and
a filter system (180) having selected characteristics for filtering the fluid outflow returning to the fluid source (60);
wherein the control algorithms provide fluid inflow into a uterine cavity and fluid outflow at a selected outflow rate;
characterized by:
wherein the filter system characteristics and outflow rate are selected to result in substantially no change in an electrolyte concentration of a filtrate.
